%%{init: {'theme':'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as 🤝 A2A Agent
    participant S as 📨 /a2a (JSON-RPC + HTTP+JSON)
    participant F as 📊 Auth + rate limit
    participant T as 💾 EfA2aTaskStore
    participant AG as 🧠 KnowledgeHubA2AAgent
    participant CAT as 🧰 DynamicToolCatalog
    participant DB as 💾 Catalog DB (SQLite/Postgres)
    participant P as 📡 A2aPushNotifier
    participant W as ☁️ Agent webhook

    A->>S: GET /.well-known/agent-card.json
    S-->>A: Agent Card (skills, inputModes,<br/>pushNotifications:true)

    A->>S: message/send (skill, contextId?, config?)
    S->>F: Operational policy (aft_* scope)<br/>+ llm rate limit
    S->>T: CreateTask
    T->>DB: INSERT task (persisted, restart-safe)
    T-->>S: taskId

    opt pushNotificationConfig (inline ou CRUD)
        S->>DB: save webhook URL (EgressPolicy valida destino — SSRF guard)
    end

    S->>AG: execute skill
    AG->>CAT: resolve → tool provider
    CAT-->>AG: result
    AG->>T: TaskUpdater working/artifact events<br/>(OnProgress + heartbeat 2s)
    T->>DB: UPDATE task (status + artifacts)
    loop task update
        T->>P: notify (se push configurado)
        P->>W: POST task payload<br/>X-KH-Signature (HMAC evidence:master)<br/>retry 3× exponencial
    end

    AG-->>S: terminal state (completed/failed/canceled)
    S->>T: UPDATE task
    P->>W: POST terminal state + signature

    Note over A,T: restart/deploy aqui não perde a task

    A->>S: tasks/get (taskId)
    S->>T: GetTask
    T->>DB: SELECT (EF, sem cache in-memory)
    T-->>S: task + artifacts + history
    S-->>A: task

    opt tasks/cancel
        A->>S: tasks/cancel (taskId)
        S->>T: CancelTask → cooperative cancel
        T->>DB: UPDATE task (canceled)
    end

    Note over T,DB: purge diário via MaintenanceBackgroundService<br/>A2a:TaskRetentionHours (default 72h)
